  "ingredients": [
    "3 cups fresh blueberries",
    "0.33333334326744 cup orange juice",
    "3 tablespoons white sugar",
    "0.66666668653488 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.25 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "0.5 cup butter, softened",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "1 egg",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients and preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iataWvXGDhqwZXjU3uJrFOXDoS0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15373-Best-Ever-Blueberry-Cobbler-DDMFS-2862-4x3-Ingredients-63ece95209b94809b896841507df93f5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15373/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix blueberries, orange juice, and 3 tablespoons sugar in an 8-inch square baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1LZpVYDug2oh9bDfa0w5UKIIQtw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15373-Best-Ever-Blueberry-Cobbler-DDMFS-2865-4x3-step-01-218a0e412520476b8b0d607f2b0e3127.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15373/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix flour, baking powder, and salt in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BcVhG3tZdOciD-46CNFN_gk6rnU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15373-Best-Ever-Blueberry-Cobbler-DDMFS-2873-4x3-Step-02-ac831c65d5dd4c79bc7095e6c2f43c5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15373/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cream butter and 1/2 cup sugar in a large bowl until light and fluffy. Beat in egg and vanilla. Gradually add flour mixture, stirring just until ingredients are combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lpDQpZ5sqdxJJTrns6Ylyj0blvI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15373-Best-Ever-Blueberry-Cobbler-DDMFS-2909-4x3-Step-04-437d940db5a24fc3b41882dfbb89c471.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15373/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop spoonfuls of batter over the blueberry mixture, covering as much filling as possible.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cgKabolfjTnxJikIjOLvStpN72Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15373-Best-Ever-Blueberry-Cobbler-DDMFS-2919-4x3-Step-05-9ef6bc0bdabd4781a636bba0201cb22b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15373/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until topping is golden brown and filling bubbles, 35 to 40 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QO7X04BVzMaYZOl6C6S_B98fEtM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15373-Best-Ever-Blueberry-Cobbler-DDMFS-2948-4x3-Step-06-6d4b645f829c465fb252c2c12c18d452.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15373/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy! Sweeten up your summertime with this blueberry cobbler recipe, in which a fruity filling is perfectly complemented by an irresistible cake-like topping. Perfect as is, or served alongside whipped cream or a scoop of vanilla ice cream. Home cooks love to customize the recipe with different types of berries and spices.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
